{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And I, behold, I have taken.</b> And from where did I merit them — <b>from among the children of Israel</b> — that Israel should hire them for My service? Through the firstborn I merited them, and I took them in their stead. For the service was in the firstborn, and when they sinned with the calf they were disqualified, and the Levites, who did not worship idolatry, were chosen in their place (see Zevachim 112)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:13.153052079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}